                <td style="width: 661.344px; height: 26px;" rowspan="1" colspan="1"><italic toggle="yes">MUC5B (rs35705950)</italic>,&#x000a0;telomere genes (<italic toggle="yes"><italic toggle="yes">TERT, TERC, RTEL1, PARN,&#x000a0;</italic></italic><italic toggle="yes"><italic toggle="yes">DKC1, TINF2)</italic></italic></td>
